WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-01 - Nineteen and Invincible
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:26.247 --> 00:00:30.310
The college books are open wide

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:35.032
With my whole world right by my side

00:00:35.192 --> 00:00:39.996
A quiet laugh, a knowing look

00:00:40.056 --> 00:00:44.000
A chapter from a favorite book

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.000
The future's just a distant shore

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.000
I couldn't ask for anything more

00:00:49.063 --> 00:00:51.800
Than this small room, this gentle space

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.168
A perfect time, a perfect place

00:00:54.308 --> 00:00:59.500
And I've got my three guiding stars

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.034
Healing all my childhood scars

00:01:03.054 --> 00:01:07.500
A sister's strength, a sister's grace

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.280
A best friend's warm and kind embrace

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:16.500
This is the only life I need

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:19.800
A perfect, rare, and precious creed

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:24.800
Yeah, I'm nineteen and invincible

00:01:25.224 --> 00:01:28.146
With a love that's unconditional

00:01:28.500 --> 00:02:05.500
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:05.902 --> 00:02:10.500
We talk for hours on the phone

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.800
I never feel like I'm alone

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.800
You get the jokes inside my head

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.432
On every single word unsaid

00:02:20.552 --> 00:02:23.800
We're just a team of misfit souls

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.800
Making each other brave and whole

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:30.258
No need to search, no need to roam

00:02:30.358 --> 00:02:34.862
'Cause with the three of you, I'm home

00:02:37.788 --> 00:02:41.789
Yeah, the world is out there, big and wide

00:02:41.829 --> 00:02:45.590
But I've got nothing left to hide

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:49.200
With my team right here, my crew, my friends

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:52.500
The story never has to end

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:55.800
We're gonna chase the summer sun

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:59.193
Our real adventure's just begun

00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:02.200
Got a full tank and a radio

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.234
And everywhere is ours to go!

00:03:05.274 --> 00:03:08.500
And I feel the rhythm, I feel the beat

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.018
Of my own heart on a crowded street

00:03:11.098 --> 00:03:14.500
We're coming back to the kids we knew

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:18.500
In shades of brilliant white and blue

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:22.990
This is the sound of being free

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:27.174
This is the sound of being me!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:04:04.400
[Guitar Solo]

00:04:04.712 --> 00:04:08.814
And I feel the rhythm, I feel the beat

00:04:08.874 --> 00:04:12.835
Of my own heart on a crowded street

00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:16.877
We're coming back to the kids we knew

00:04:16.937 --> 00:04:20.200
In shades of brilliant white and blue

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:23.459
This is the sound of being free

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.721
This is the sound of being me!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:44.000
[Outro]
